'''Michelia''' (ミシェリア) is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Michelia
|image = E 349.png
|appearance = [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 750¢ - 2,962¢
}}

==Enemy==
Has longer range than most enemies from the same collab. However, her stats are not that good, she has a plus long attack delay.

==Strategy==
This enemy is not much of a threat, so any decently strong unit can take her out with ease.

